      "reported_volume_a3": 260.49,
      "resolution": "Retain all printed values verbatim and use the reported V column for the EOS reproduction. The other 15 rows reproduce V=(sqrt(3)/2)*a^2*c within 0.01 A^3; the isolated 0.242 A^3 mismatch is larger than rounding but lies within the reported 0.89 A^3 volume uncertainty."
     }
    ],
